    longDescription: "The Birkenstock Arizona is the sandal that started a global comfort revolution and never looked back. Designed in Germany and barely changed since 1973, it remains the benchmark for supportive, healthy footwear that your feet will thank you for.\n\nThe contoured cork-latex footbed features a deep heel cup, arch support, and toe bar that work together to distribute weight evenly and encourage natural foot movement. Over time, the footbed moulds to the exact shape of your foot, creating a personalised fit that no other sandal can replicate. A jute insole between the footbed and the EVA sole adds cushioning and breathability.\n\nTwo adjustable buckle straps secure the foot in place without pressure points. The suede upper softens and develops a patina with wear. Available in Birko-Flor Tan, Black, and Silver — all with the distinctive Birkenstock logo moulded into the buckle. Resolable and repairable for a lifetime of wear.",
