    longDescription: "Concept2 RowErg is the definitive rowing machine — used in Olympic training centres, elite CrossFit competitions, and the world's most demanding performance environments. When any athlete, coach, or sports scientist says 'the rower' without further qualification, they mean the Concept2. It has set the global standard for indoor rowing for over four decades, and nothing has come close to matching its combination of accuracy, durability, and data fidelity.\n\nThe flywheel air resistance mechanism is self-regulating: pull harder and resistance automatically increases in proportion to your effort — no settings needed, just pure physics. This makes the RowErg uniquely responsive and ensures results from the machine translate directly to on-water rowing performance. The PM5 Performance Monitor accurately measures each stroke's power output, stroke rate, and distance, providing data that coaches trust for training prescription and race simulation.\n\nConncet2 hosts the online Concept2 Logbook — a global database of athlete performance where you can compare your 500m, 2000m, and 10km times against millions of rowers worldwide, participate in ranked challenges, and track long-term performance trends. The RowErg separates into two pieces for storage, fitting in a closet or standing upright in a corner. Capacity of 500lbs accommodates nearly every athlete. Concept2 has manufactured over one million ergometers — a testament to a product so good that professional teams, elite universities, and Olympians simply never switch.",
