    longDescription: "Arc'teryx Beta Jacket is the apex predator of waterproof outerwear — the jacket that serious mountaineers, ski guides, and alpinists choose when failure is not an option. Arc'teryx engineers obsessively optimise every technical garment detail, and the Beta represents decades of iteration informed by real-world use in the most extreme mountain environments on earth.\n\nGore-Tex Pro — the highest performance waterproof-breathable membrane available — provides a fully seam-sealed barrier against sustained rain, snow, and sleet while allowing metabolic moisture to escape continuously during high-output activity. Unlike lower-tier Gore-Tex variants, Gore-Tex Pro maintains its breathability under high pressure against packs and harnesses, making it genuinely usable while loaded. The helmet-compatible Storm Hood adjusts with one hand while wearing gloves — a critical detail that separates genuine alpine kit from gear designed to look technical.\n\nPit zippers provide direct ventilation during high-output ascents without removing the jacket. The WaterTight™ zippers maintain waterproof integrity at every opening. A DWR coating on the face fabric ensures water beads off immediately without saturating the outer layer, preserving breathability. The Beta's minimalist cut — no unnecessary pockets or detailing — reduces weight and eliminates the pressure points that cause discomfort under a loaded backpack. Arc'teryx's industry-leading construction quality is backed by a lifetime warranty. This is the last rain jacket you will ever need.",
